ta hai ki woh ab bhi chhah hai. Kya woh sahi hai?"},{"who":"child","text":"nahi... 6 ulta hua toh 9 ban gaya na?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, 6 ulta batao toh 9 ban jaata hai, chhah nahi. Ab teen chidiya taar par baithi hain. Teeno udd gayin. Taar par kitni chidiya bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, teeno chidiya udd gayin, toh ek bhi nahi bachi. Ab cricket mein batsman bina run banaye out ho gaya. Uska score kya likhenge?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, bina run ke score zero hota hai. Ab ulta gino: teen, do, ek. Uske baad kya aayega?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, ek ke baad ulta ginte hue zero aata hai. Ab cricket jersey par 7 likha hai. Utni kitni taaliyaan bajaoge?"},{"who":"child","text":"saat taaliyaan"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, 7 ke liye saat taaliyaan. Ab nau ko kaun se numeral se likhte hain?"},{"who":"child","text":"No, it becomes 9"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, tum sahi keh rahe ho: 6 ko ulta karo toh 9 banta hai. Maine tumhari baat galat samjhi, sorry. Saat bolna aur 7 likhna ek hi ginti batate hain. Aaj ke liye yahin rukein?"},{"who":"child","text":"umm... game khelein?"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, khelte hain! Main kuch khelne ke liye taiyaar kar rahi hoon. Tab tak batao: do rotiyaan thi, tumne dono kha li. Kitni bachi?"},{"who":"child","text":"zero"},{"who":"teacher","text":"Haan, dono rotiyaan kha li, toh zero bachi. Game nahi aaya, toh bolkar khelte hain. Main number ka naam bolungi, tum numeral bolo. Paanch ko kis numeral se likhte hain?"}],"usage":{"usd":0.07026,"tokens":44413},"boards":4,"lastMs":4486,"screen":{"on":"nothing","texts":[],"words":"nothing is on the screen"},"learner":{"c1-maths-ch03-t02-s1":{"read":"understood","graded":[{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i01","kind":"practice"},{"g":"correct","item":"c1-maths-ch03-t02-i09","kind":"near_transfer"}],"grades":["correct","correct"],"evidence":"Saat taaliy